        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "80cbe1a7-42ee-316b-acf1-4713eacc2f81",
                "word": "inconfort",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "eca3bc73-d5b3-4bf8-a081-da148f4fd4bc",
                        "entry_id": "80cbe1a7-42ee-316b-acf1-4713eacc2f81",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "inconforts"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                        "entry_id": "80cbe1a7-42ee-316b-acf1-4713eacc2f81",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Absence de confort."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc72c510-de14-4b58-830f-3f81e5078745",
                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                "text": "Contrairement à beaucoup d’érudits en chambre, notre confrère profitait de ses inspections communales pour mener ses enquêtes sociologiques ou folkloriques sur le terrain, souvent dans des conditions d’inconfort inimaginables."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf07a130-57e9-4092-9206-e6a6289adaae",
                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                "text": "À l'instant, je me sens au milieu de nulle part. C'est une sensation de malaise indescriptible, un inconfort inqualifiable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "599f1d54-4cb0-4d2b-b551-0358fc5c72f0",
                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                "text": "L’Association du Barreau canadien (ABC), organisme où milite un très grand nombre de candidats à la magistrature pour faire preuve d’« engagement » dans la communauté, a manifesté son inconfort dans deux communiqués récents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a92030dc-b398-4931-bccd-0b6f80ded706",
                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                "text": "La clim est « un fort vecteur d’inégalités entre les groupes sociaux. Pour le confort de quelques-uns, elle va augmenter l’ inconfort de l’ensemble de la population » en augmentant le réchauffement à l’extérieur, dans les endroits partagés, commente Géraldine Molina."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69a48eda-3551-41bb-ae29-0c27e65bf574",
                        "source_entry_id": "80cbe1a7-42ee-316b-acf1-4713eacc2f81",
                        "source_sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                        "target_lang_word": "discomfort",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "discomfort",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ddd0ad6-27cf-32fe-a8f0-77c71b0327a0",
                                        "entry_id": "1d56a6cb-e83f-3b99-884e-3d35f8129cc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mental or bodily distress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f31acca0-f130-4d5f-be93-6a97198e9b7c",
                                                "sense_id": "2ddd0ad6-27cf-32fe-a8f0-77c71b0327a0",
                                                "text": "[…] although overcrowding on the trains running via London Bridge has occasioned considerable discomfort to regular travellers, it was noticed that the alternative route was not extensively patronised, and that the trains were seldom more than half-filled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0992be77-aff9-4a6d-ae9c-1165243902db",
                                                "sense_id": "2ddd0ad6-27cf-32fe-a8f0-77c71b0327a0",
                                                "text": "The Western operating authorities are wisely concentrating their main line diesel power at individual sheds, beginning with Laira, so that engine-crews do not have the rather demoralising experience of switching about constantly between the comfort and ease of diesel handling and the relative discomfort and hard work of the steam footplate, as on other Regions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63a4d122-0fcb-3ed1-9387-6906efc627f7",
                                        "entry_id": "1d56a6cb-e83f-3b99-884e-3d35f8129cc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that disturbs one’s comfort; an annoyance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae969769-f09e-45ee-a514-867c921a9f68",
                                                "sense_id": "63a4d122-0fcb-3ed1-9387-6906efc627f7",
                                                "text": "Even without hovering drones, a lurking assassin, a thumping score and a denouement, the real-life story of Edward Snowden, a rogue spy on the run, could be straight out of the cinema. But, as with Hollywood, the subplots and exotic locations may distract from the real message: America’s discomfort and its foes’ glee."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c43b9dea-a5fa-4088-a1c6-fb6dd56c4cac",
                                                "sense_id": "63a4d122-0fcb-3ed1-9387-6906efc627f7",
                                                "text": "This happened in the past several years, and it worsened conditions in sectors such as foreign debt, electricity output, rubbish collection, water delivery, and other essential services, to the discomfort of the majority of Lebanese who have spoken out intermittently against the oligarchy of sectarian leaders who rule the country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "discomfort",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1b202bb-2cb1-348f-bfc0-43c141e7bb79",
                                        "entry_id": "326f1b40-4a0e-36b5-9bd3-b5d8d0a35a2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause annoyance or distress to."
